{"layout":"logicalStructure","root":{"data":{"text":"<p>图形处理单元</p>","expand":true,"uid":"7f669d6e-58e6-4d63-af1f-ebfaece08b24","richText":true,"isActive":false,"imgMap":{},"freeNodeTrees":[{"data":{"text":"<p>渲染管线</p>","uid":"77cf5ebc-1314-4f7a-a3f1-11df5c598679","freeNodeTreeToMainRootOffset":[15,440],"expand":true,"isActive":false,"richText":true},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>顶点着色器</p>","uid":"0c9ca10a-6fc9-4ecb-9f30-de0c4b336c67","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>处理顶点数据，输出数据到齐次裁剪空间</p>","uid":"c35ac153-8da2-48f3-8a3d-cdcb564938af","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>每个顶点都是独立处理，并行的</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"f4272e5d-721e-4056-b1b5-d61d5c5f0df7"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>曲面细分</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"94b67767-3ddb-4d09-9922-b23cb5e58eec"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>节省内存与带宽，提升视觉细节</p>","uid":"b1d17f3b-8888-4fbf-891a-566805978e9a","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>实现lod</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"9481a2b6-4246-486a-958b-d0a6c73379df"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>实现过程</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"df5bcbb3-290e-45e2-ba22-9f942477c16d"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>外壳着色器（可编程），传入控制点和常量，计算tf（细分因子）</p>","uid":"b9330b36-c727-41e2-96cd-689c172f2e74","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>细分着色器（固定阶段），负责“切分”的拓扑结构</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"7d2c0023-eb88-4f9f-af83-18a4bb525cda"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>域着色器（可编程）</p>","uid":"d1c2b01c-6b45-46f7-9c67-5593ad7b9da1","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>接收细分器生成的每个采样点坐标，结合外壳着色器传来的控制点信息，计算出这些新顶点的最终三维位置。也可以采样位移贴图，实现凹凸效果</p>","uid":"d8a31f46-97b8-4482-8f46-cb3faf400506","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>几何着色器</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"56d138e1-55e6-4245-b8f7-73320ce6c265"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>处理对象是图元，可以复制，删除，修改</p>","uid":"1790fe4f-c4dc-45f7-8f13-50abeb7ba31c","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>来自较早输入图元的输出图元，一定会在来自较晚输入图元的输出图元之前被传递到后续阶段</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"a6409569-6171-489b-a7ae-4b84d3419313"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>流式输出</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"faa4af19-3dd5-454e-8389-b336cc719e8c"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>顶点着色器的结果可以被输出到流，而不是管线中。从而进行迭代处理</p>","uid":"e32244db-8322-4182-8c1c-f7f52a86a368","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>像素处理</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"4a860c65-37f3-43bc-ab7a-93b0123a6782"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>片元：三角形上与像素完全或者部分重叠的部分</p>","uid":"f87e61a0-1cb2-4cc9-8a5a-f28e24ac0b35","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>mrt，渲染结果可以发送到多个模板</p>","uid":"c583b060-85ff-48ae-8b7c-dc11481e9662","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>计算和输出片元颜色，也是并行的不能访问相邻像素，但是可以通过多pass解决</p>","uid":"fab6d932-1c6d-405e-bc71-9d354d1d67b2","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>但GPU 在物理执行时，会把屏幕空间上相邻的 2×2 个像素打包成一个 Quad，让它们对应的着色器线程同时、锁步 执行</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"d5c69072-d551-4a92-9850-946af9d3b95d"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>计算Mipmap,UV在屏幕空间上的变化率</p>","uid":"81153819-3557-4135-89c7-0bf243c555a7","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>拿当前像素的变量值，减去 Quad 内相邻像素</p>","uid":"b3d9b48c-e401-403f-9406-6fe3a822adb6","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>所以梯度计算不能放在会因像素而异的动态分支里</p>","uid":"a9f82cc6-de39-4ddb-b3e1-c9a06f9277ac","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>ROV</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"8a870902-b319-48ff-bbf9-2feef1f06a04"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p> DirectX 中的一项硬件特性，它让像素着色器对 UAV（无序访问视图）的读写严格按照图元提交的先后顺序执行，从而解决透明物体重叠时的渲染顺序错乱问题</p>","uid":"c6278428-9c75-4474-add3-638e93c7e722","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>合并阶段（OM)</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"bc688cc9-6fe7-441e-af61-be1b32357217"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p> 深度/模板测试</p>","uid":"1ae809fe-d8b7-429e-9c6d-f45406a98a2e","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>混合</p>","uid":"447e2c09-8d2d-42c9-a882-60e7fb7b3b33","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>计算着色器</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"11601778-f287-4e76-b3bf-5046e94d81a6"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>DirectX11引入</p>","uid":"f88e90c8-31c9-444c-867b-2d8d1e38e3bf","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>独立于绘制调用（Draw Call）的管线流程</p>","uid":"116c8ede-9933-4f28-9a50-e7fb82386f72","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>可以访问gpu上的数据</p>","uid":"5d4183e3-fdbd-411d-a330-3ceb91ddce8c","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>可以通过调度(Dispatch)来指定要启动多少个线程组</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"cfdb1644-abd1-4439-8bb2-e0b75f16c5b7"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>每个线程组都有组内共享内存-directX11 有32kb</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"7ea125cb-cf02-4bcb-8f4d-26a0914d0c0d"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>介绍</p>","uid":"a661e657-78fc-4276-896e-c7b518025ff4","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>NVIDIA GeForce 256</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"c7e2bb6f-fdef-4975-9144-9b3d7b9e9b0e","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>第一款有顶点处理的消费级gpu</p>","uid":"dcbe8102-9542-4ec5-9d1c-9af97d00d8a9","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>处理高度可并行的任务</p>","uid":"50fd140c-65d7-490e-b7aa-f950ba607d7c","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>如何避免stall</p>","uid":"2b0b2e67-57ff-4909-a6ed-3eef70632503","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>SIM(单指令多数据）</p>","uid":"05befa61-df40-4659-9f64-8e9070756bcb","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>通过切换wrap来保持gpu保持高占用率</p>","uid":"ec562770-69af-418c-bbca-1ebe7f6901de","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>着色器输入+一块寄存器空间 =gpu 线程</p>","uid":"ab578b0b-4433-4265-8450-9ffbbbee4a83","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>同一个着色器程序的线程被分为一个组（wrap/wavefront)</p>","uid":"3ac0804a-d284-4888-85e4-2eda30b770a0","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>寄存器大小会影响wrap数据</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"f7200897-34b3-4f2c-ac5b-6b8df659b9ac"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>分支结构</p>","uid":"75da6a07-5e69-4be2-942f-7a5441dfc2e7","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>为了确保无论走哪个分支都有足够寄存器可用，编译器必须按照最坏情况（即需要寄存器最多的那个分支）来分配寄存器空间。</p>","uid":"9910635a-4234-4460-a036-20314fd40f3e","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>循环结构</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"7826d623-bcc3-4187-84c7-356bf311316a"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>为了提升指令级并行度，编译器会将循环展开</p>","uid":"aba1e94e-085c-49a6-a81e-438ee6321b25","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>线程发散</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"605de2c6-49c9-4067-b9ed-f390d52dcccc"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>if分支或者循环，使的wrap中的线程必须等待所有程序处理完</p>","uid":"348c3cc4-b990-49ed-bd74-6c59a58512bb","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>现在着色器程序具有相同的ISA(指令集架构）</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"eaea5d29-739e-4300-b4c0-2dca41f9bb19"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>统一输入</p>","uid":"99f310d8-42ba-426e-9bed-dc68b168f5ca","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>drallCall之间不变的值</p>","uid":"8f30add3-caa8-4f24-b3c7-4014253f6986","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>可变输入</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"f5b8184d-edd4-4fbe-95b5-f6c6a81f5314"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>光栅化的数据</p>","uid":"ce4cbbc7-1188-42eb-a412-33ac5bf6870b","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>着色器语言</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"161120ed-2ec5-4363-8e21-108fea36d145"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>DirectX</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"765caf53-a309-4664-95da-fb410d99fe39"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>由微软控制，与amd,英伟达等公司合作开发</p>","uid":"87c901a4-2e28-4433-bcfe-9e1e1bde0df6","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>OpenGL</p>","uid":"66440151-1865-4aec-91dd-ad1e13d6c335","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>由非盈利组织-Khronos 管理（科纳斯）</p>","uid":"e4a67248-fa97-49ac-a8f5-fa8cc691fd1a","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>Vulkan</p>","uid":"0f3b8386-f499-462c-af7f-8ca29173f2e3","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>khronos发布，amd作出贡献Mantle。跨平台性能好</p>","uid":"5d4c8dc9-1943-4ad3-8dfb-f455a97fd5c6","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>OpenGL ES,WebGL</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"e3668af1-9f3a-432e-b1e4-7f458a0bcff1"},"children":[]}]}]},"theme":{"template":"code","config":{}},"view":{"transform":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"shear":0,"rotate":0,"translateX":-654,"translateY":-469,"originX":0,"originY":0,"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"e":-654,"f":-469},"state":{"scale":1,"x":-654,"y":-469,"sx":-574,"sy":-713}}}